## 🧹 Cleanup (Save Money!)

**Important:** Delete these resources to avoid charges:

```bash
# 1. Delete Auto Scaling Group
aws autoscaling delete-auto-scaling-group --auto-scaling-group-name WebApp-ASG --force-delete

# 2. Delete Load Balancer
aws elbv2 delete-load-balancer --load-balancer-arn (get from console)

# 3. Delete Target Group
aws elbv2 delete-target-group --target-group-arn (get from console)

# 4. Delete Launch Template
aws ec2 delete-launch-template --launch-template-name WebApp-LT
```

